## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Muster
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.2.1
## Notes: The muster: every player's kit and record at a glance. A gear score and average item level on your character panel and on the inspect window, and the same two numbers — with arena ratings — on the tooltip of any player you mouse over, learned from a quiet background inspect and remembered for the session. Muster is also the suite's one source of arena ratings: what it has seen, merged with the Commander Ladder web feed when that is installed, so a rating can show for players nobody has inspected.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Note_02
